    "md5": "15f07fa5b16bce0b676d18b732fea50a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1696,
    "chunk_text": "Ather showcases innovation at Colombo EV Motor Show 2026\n\nAt Colombo EV Motor Show 2026, Ather and Evolution Auto showcased Ather 450X, attracting strong interest from customers, enthusiasts and prospective buyers throughout the three-day event.\n\nAther Energy, Sri Lanka\u2019s premium electric scooter brand, continues to strengthen its position in the country\u2019s rapidly growing electric mobility sector through its authorised distributor Evolution Auto.\n\nAs one of Evolution Auto\u2019s flagship brands, Ather has consistently been positioned in the minds of consumers as the \u2018super scooter\u2019, a reputation built on advanced technology, performance and intelligent design.\n\nThe visitors explored the scooter\u2019s connected technology, performance and engineering, with the showcase receiving an enthusiastic response.\n\nThe engagement reflected the growing demand for premium electric mobility solutions in Sri Lanka and the increasing interest in products that combine innovation with everyday usability.\n\nDesigned to make every day riding more intuitive, comfortable and convenient, Ather introduced two new features to the Sri Lankan market - Infinite Cruise and Magic twist.\u00a0 These features reflect Ather\u2019s continued focus on developing innovations that address real-world riding needs. Together, they enhance rider confidence, improve convenience and deliver a more effortless riding experience.\n\nInfinite Cruise is designed to deliver a seamless riding experience by maintaining consistent speed control, especially during long rides or steady traffic conditions. It reduces rider fatigue and allows for a more relaxed and controlled journey, particularly in urban commuting environments."
