    "chunk_text": "Infinite Cruise is designed to deliver a seamless riding experience by maintaining consistent speed control, especially during long rides or steady traffic conditions. It reduces rider fatigue and allows for a more relaxed and controlled journey, particularly in urban commuting environments.\n\nUnlike conventional systems, Magic Twist can bring the scooter to a complete halt and continues to work even when the battery is fully charged. This makes stop-and-go city riding more effortless and comfortable."
