    "description": "Sri Lanka advances regional trade framework with full SLAB digitalisation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Sri-Lanka-advances-regional-trade-framework-with-full-SLAB-digitalisation/273-345960",
