    "chunk_size_bytes": 1734,
    "chunk_text": "The 34th edition of FACETS Sri Lanka will include dedicated sections that showcase the island\u2019s world\u2011renowned sapphires and contemporary luxury jewellery, while a series of special events \u2014 including Sapphire Night, Story Corner, Power Breakfast, Mine Tour and Port City Tour \u2014 will create opportunities for networking, knowledge\u2011sharing and collaboration.\n\nThe SLGJA unveiled the FACETS 2027 theme and promotional teaser video during the media conference, while also announcing the event dates for the next three years, reinforcing the exhibition\u2019s role as a cornerstone of Sri Lanka\u2019s gem and jewellery calendar.\u00a0 FACETS Sri Lanka 2028 will be held from January 5 to 7, FACETS Sri Lanka 2029 from January 4 to 6 and FACETS Sri Lanka 2030 from January 6 to 8.\n\nSpeaking on the significance of the event, SLGJA President Akram Cassim remarked, \u201cFACETS 2027 represents the very best of Sri Lanka. It brings together our centuries\u2011old gemstone heritage, our skilled artisans, our entrepreneurs and our spirit of innovation, reminding the world that Sri Lanka is not only the source of exceptional gemstones but also a trusted destination for excellence in the global gem\n\nFACETS Sri Lanka 2027 Chairman Shezmin Mansoor added, \u201cFACETS 2027 shines a spotlight on the journey of Sri Lanka\u2019s greatest natural treasures. More than an exhibition, FACETS is a celebration of our heritage, our artisans and the pursuit of perfection that has established Sri Lanka as a trusted leader in the global gem and jewellery industry. We invite you to discover nature\u2019s rarest treasures, its people and the purpose behind every facet. FACETS is where the world comes together to craft the future and to celebrate excellence.\u201d"
