    "description": "the French Parliament  passes  historic  Assisted Death Bill",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/the-French-Parliament-passes-historic-Assisted-Death-Bill/172-345966",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1784308722.0,
