    "chunk_text": "Over 700 arrested in islandwide \u2018Ratama Ekata\u2019 operation\n\nColombo, July 18 (Daily Mirror) - A total of 706 individuals were arrested yesterday (July 17) during the islandwide \u201cRatama Ekata\u201d national operation.\n\nAccording to Police, the arrests were made during 708 raids conducted across the country.\n\nAmong those arrested, an investigation into suspected illegally acquired assets has been launched against one suspect, while 11 others are being detained under detention orders for further investigations.\n\nPolice also said that steps have been taken to refer four suspects for rehabilitation."
