    "description": "India amends tax treaty with Sri Lanka to plug avoidance",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/India-amends-tax-treaty-with-Sri-Lanka-to-plug-avoidance/108-346031",
    "lang": "en",
