    "description": "Tintin to Tranquility Base: New race for the moon",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Tintin-to-Tranquility-Base-New-race-for-the-moon/4-794839",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
