    "chunk_text": "One killed over a brawl after cattle destroy vegetable cultivation\n\nColombo, July 20 (Daily Mirror) - A person has been killed over a brawl in Hungama after a brawl he had with another person after his cattle destroyed the vegetable cultivation belonging to the latter.\n\nThe victim had actually visited the residence of the suspect to pay compensation to him after his cattle destroyed the long bean cultivation belonging\u00a0to the latter who is to be arrested. The victim was hacked to death by the suspect and his brother.\n\nThe police have launched an operation to arrest the two suspects.\n\nThe victim had passed away after he was admitted to the hospital. An argument which arose during a discussion had eventually turned into a physical clash during which the murder had taken place ."
